  "description": [
    "The rocky wall curves from the south to the northwest.  Bladder rockweed clings to the stones and sways in slow motion.  Schools of mud shrimp scurry among the rockweed.  A few loggerhead sponges the size of large pumpkins grow in the sand of the bay floor."
